ental spirit of the  earth  or is she something else what role do  you think that she is going to play  in the rest of the story let me know  down below so  even before they arrived in elysia dryad  knew that the heart kingdom gang was  coming  and she also knows that the door to the  afterlife the tree of cliffhoth  is about to open and of course because  she knows that  she also knows that if a bunch of devils  invade  this world then that would be very bad  news for elysia  and for that reason dryad decides to  work together with the heart kingdom  gang  and to help them out dryad ends up  teaching everyone  how to use ultimate magic an overpowered  secret technique that is normally used  exclusively by the elves  this is because the human body is just  too weak to channel all of that mana  effectively  however because the heart kingdom gang  has the ability to channel the mana of  nature  because of the techniques that they  learned inside the heart  kingdom dryad believes that she can  actually teach them to use the ultimate  magic technique  even though they are not elves if they  only had access to their own  mana these humans would never be able to  use  that technique but because they now also  have access to the mana of nature  with dryad's help they will be able to  transcend  the true magic of the heart kingdom and  they will be able to use the  even stronger ultimate magic of the  elf tribe back in the present the heart  kingdom gang  begins using their true magic to  annihilate those lower tier devils who  were pouring out of the tree of  cliffhoth and invading the spade kingdom  capital  i mean these guys are basically just npc  devils so they were used as a way for  the heart kingdom gang to demonstrate  the extent of their cool new powers  sally is especially excited about true  magic's ability to take out enemies  while sparing  all their allies on the battlefield and  she hopes that she will get to research  this magic at  some point in the future